    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNumber 254 Ros Caoin is a beautifully presented four-bedroom detached home enjoying a prime position within this popular residential development in Roscam, one of Galway's most sought-after locations just 6km from the city centre. The property is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers spacious, well-proportioned accommodation ideally suited to modern family living.\n\nConstructed by O'Malley Homes, the property has been exceptionally well maintained and is ready for immediate occupation. The open-plan kitchen and dining area forms the heart of the home, while a bright and spacious sitting room provides an excellent reception space. Just off the dining area is a lovely conservatory which overlooks and provides direct access to the rear garden, creating an additional living space that can be enjoyed throughout the year. A utility room and guest WC complete the ground floor accommodation. Upstairs, there are four generous bedrooms, including a spacious main bedroom with en-suite, together with a well-appointed family bathroom.\n\nA particular feature of the property is the attractive paved rear garden, which enjoys a highly desirable south-facing aspect, making it an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining and enjoying all-day sunshine.\n\nThis property presents an opportunity to acquire a high-quality detached home in a sought-after location, offering excellent accommodation, turnkey condition and a private south-facing rear garden that is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nTiled floor, under stairs storage, coved ceiling, carpet on stairs.\n\nLiving Room: - \nSemi solid timber floor, coved ceiling, built in alcove shelving and storage, solid fuel stove, large front aspect bay window.\n\nDining Room: - \nSemi solid timber floor, coved ceiling, double doors to living room.\n\nKitchen: - \nBright room with rooflight, floor and wall kitchen units, tiled floor, integrated oven, hob & extractor, plumbed for dishwasher, recess lighting, rear and side apsect windows.\n\nConservatory: - \nSemi solid timber floor, built in storage, access to rear garden.\n\nWC: - \nTiled floor, wc, wash hand basin with vanity unit, mirror, side aspect window.\n\nUtility Room: - \nTiled floor, storage unit, plumbed for washing machine & dryer.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nLarge bay window, carpet on floor, built in wardrobe & Juliet balcony.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nFully tiled with wc, wash hand basin with vanity unit, mirror cabinet, electric shower & side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nCarpet on floor, fitted wardrobe, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nCarpet on floor, built in wardrobe, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 4: - \nCarpet on floor, built in wardrobe, front aspect window.\n\nBathroom: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin with vanity unit, bath, electric shower, mirror, side aspect window.\n\nHot Press: - \nShelved, hot water tank.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Excellent location</li><li>South facing rear garden</li><li>Private paved rear garden</li><li>Off street parking</li><li>Beautifully presented</li><li>Spacious accommodation</ul>"
